WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.560
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain a Russian comedy film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.520
called “The Pregnant”. Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:21.280
Sergey is a news reporter living somewhere in&nbsp;
Russia. He and his wife Diana have been trying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:26.960
to have a child for the past two years but haven’t&nbsp;
been successful. At the beginning of the movie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:32.320
Sergey is with a therapist telling her about&nbsp;
his problems. He says that he wants a baby so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:38.160
much that he has begun to dream about pacifiers&nbsp;
and strollers. The therapist asks him if he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:43.440
done the one thing that is necessary to get his&nbsp;
wife pregnant. Sergey proudly claims that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:47.647
have intercourse every night but his wife never&nbsp;
seems to get pregnant. They tried to change the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:49.680
setting and have intercourse in cars but to&nbsp;
no avail. Sergei even wrote his wish down&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:54.800
on paper and ate it one time, but that didn't&nbsp;
work either. The therapist tells him that his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.800 --> 00:01:00.320
thoughts will become reality very soon, so he&nbsp;
should be careful. Sergei doesn’t understand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:06.000
what she means but he doesn’t question her.
On his way to work, he calls his friend and lawyer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.680
Zhora. Zhora has consecutively lost eight of&nbsp;
his previous cases and is struggling because of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:17.280
financial difficulties. He has two daughters and&nbsp;
is trying for a son again. After talking to him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:22.400
Sergei gets to the set and presents a show&nbsp;
with his co-host. Somewhere else, Diana is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:26.720
at an art exhibition where all the pictures&nbsp;
she has taken recently are being displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:32.160
Sergei is late as usual. When called, he&nbsp;
claims that he is already inside the car&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:38.240
and will be there in only five minutes. But after&nbsp;
the call, his car is towed away for being parked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:43.520
in a restricted zone. Knowing that his wife will&nbsp;
find out about the lie, he ditches the exhibition&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:48.240
and instead goes to a bar with Zhora. As&nbsp;
they talk about children, Zhora mentions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:52.720
that his wife is one month pregnant. They are&nbsp;
hopeful that it will be a boy this time because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:57.760
Zhora wore felt boots while making love.
Their family has a superstitious belief that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:02.240
every time a man makes love in those&nbsp;
shoes, the woman gives birth to a boy;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:08.880
that is how Zhora, his father, and his grandfather&nbsp;
were born. The next day is Valentine's day. Sergei&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:13.680
and Diana go to the place they first met five&nbsp;
years ago. They promise to come to the place&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:19.760
with their children someday. Before returning&nbsp;
home, Sergei goes to buy felt boots. At night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:24.800
after having intercourse, he takes the shoes off&nbsp;
and hugs them, hoping to soon be blessed with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:31.040
a child. When he cannot fall asleep, he walks up&nbsp;
to the window and prays. Seconds later, he sees a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:36.400
falling star. Ten days after the incident, Sergei&nbsp;
is in the studio, presenting a program about a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:43.840
chicken named Sonya. Sonya is a miracle animal and&nbsp;
the rebirth of Paul the Octopus. She can predict&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:48.560
the winners of football matches by laying eggs.&nbsp;
The number of eggs she lays is considered the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:54.240
number of goals the winning team will score.
While reporting the news, Sergei suddenly pukes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:59.440
He apologizes and gets back to work, unaware&nbsp;
of the real reason for his morning sickness.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:04.000
Later, he is at the grocery store buying&nbsp;
things for dinner when the pickle shelf catches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:08.240
his attention. He has never liked sour&nbsp;
things in his life but for some reason,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:14.800
he craves pickles more than anything that day. On&nbsp;
the phone, Zhora jokes about him being pregnant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:20.720
but Sergei remembers his wish and thinks it might&nbsp;
be a possibility. That night, he finds Diana’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:26.560
pregnancy kit in the cupboard and decides to test&nbsp;
his theory. At first, he sees the two red lines on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:31.440
the kit and thinks it means he isn’t pregnant.&nbsp;
But after reading the instructions, he figures&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:36.720
out that two lines mean he might have a baby&nbsp;
inside of him. He takes the test a few more times&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:43.280
but the results come back positive every single&nbsp;
time. The idea is so absurd to him that at one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:51.600
point he starts laughing at the positive test.
The next morning, he has pickles for breakfast.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:57.280
Diana notices his weird behavior and inquires what&nbsp;
is wrong. When Sergei tells her they are about to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.280 --> 00:04:02.640
have a baby, she thinks he cheated on her. But on&nbsp;
finding out that he is the one who is pregnant,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:08.000
she gets even more upset, thinking that he has&nbsp;
gone insane. Sergei wants her to be happy about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:13.280
being a father, but Diana needs some time&nbsp;
to take it all in. That evening, Sergei’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:18.960
parents and Zhora’s family come to their house for&nbsp;
dinner. Sergei takes the opportunity to officially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:24.320
announce his pregnancy. The family is left&nbsp;
speechless at the announcement. They calmly try to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:29.840
explain that him bearing a child is impossible.&nbsp;
Sergei storms out without saying anything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:35.360
leaving everyone else in awkward silence. 
His father blames his mother for doing pregnancy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:40.960
yoga which he thinks messed with Sergei’s autonomy&nbsp;
and made him a woman from the inside. The next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:46.000
morning, Sergei reads a book on pregnancy&nbsp;
and identifies his symptoms. He keeps the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:51.120
negativity aside and starts to prepare for the&nbsp;
child’s arrival. On calculating the due date,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:56.880
he is happy to find his child will be a Leo.&nbsp;
Starting that day, Sergei stops smoking and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:01.920
eats pickles with every meal. He even listens&nbsp;
to children’s bedtime stories so the baby could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:07.120
hear them too. With time, Diana comes to terms&nbsp;
with the pregnancy and supports him to her best.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:12.560
Four months into the pregnancy, Sergei now&nbsp;
has a protruded belly. He goes to pregnancy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:17.680
classes every day but pretends to be there to&nbsp;
better understand his wife. The mothers do not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:22.080
question his belly and think that he is just&nbsp;
trying to get the authentic experience. 
&nbsp;

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:26.880
While all his close ones know about the pregnancy,&nbsp;
he has chosen to hide it from the rest of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:32.800
world. In the fifth month, Sergei and Diana go&nbsp;
to a gynecologist for the first time. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:38.400
as soon as the doctor sees that the husband is&nbsp;
the one who is pregnant, he refuses to treat him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:43.680
In a similar way, the couple visits many doctors&nbsp;
but none of them accept him as a patient.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:49.360
Then, one day they come across Dr. Tikhonov&nbsp;
who has been in the business for two months&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:54.240
but hasn’t gotten a single patient. Because&nbsp;
he is desperate, he agrees to treat Sergei.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:59.360
The doctor asks him to get on a delivery bed but&nbsp;
a stupid Sergei cannot figure out what goes on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:04.480
leg holder. Because of his unique condition,&nbsp;
he has to be on all fours for the checkup.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:10.160
The following day at work, Sergei finds out that&nbsp;
Zhora has allowed the show to broadcast about his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:15.200
pregnancy. As the word gets around, everyone&nbsp;
is intrigued by the man who got pregnant. 
&nbsp;

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:20.320
It becomes an international sensation, much to&nbsp;
Sergei’s annoyance because he wanted to keep&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:26.000
it a secret. People in the streets and the bus&nbsp;
now recognize him as the man who was knocked up.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:29.840
They treat him like an outcast which&nbsp;
doesn’t help Sergei’s mental health.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:35.520
He confronts Zhora about selling him out for&nbsp;
money but the man shows no regret. Instead,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:40.800
he claims that he has more ideas that will&nbsp;
make both of them millionaires. At first,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:46.320
Sergei curses him out, claiming that he won’t&nbsp;
sell his pregnancy. But when he calms down, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:52.400
money doesn’t sound so bad to him. Starting that&nbsp;
day, he goes to several TV programs and shows as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:58.160
the pregnant guy. He is also made the sponsor of&nbsp;
several maternity products. His popularity grows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:04.160
immensely in only a few weeks. He is surrounded by&nbsp;
paparazzi everywhere he goes and even his family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:09.440
members are interviewed by many reporters.
One day, he is at a restaurant when a gay couple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:14.640
approaches him. They too want to know the way&nbsp;
a man can have a child. Sergei has no clue how&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:19.600
he got pregnant but he still advises them to&nbsp;
wear a pair of felt boots during intercourse&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:24.560
and do it in a green room. In the next&nbsp;
gynecologist appointment, the couple finds out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:30.640
that they are having a boy. Outside, the reporters&nbsp;
surround Sergei again. He gets so caught up in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:35.760
their questions that he doesn’t notice Diana&nbsp;
being left behind. Ever since he got famous,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:41.120
he hasn’t been the loving husband that he used to&nbsp;
be. Following that, Sergei gets a show of his own&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:46.160
where he provides maternity advice to women.&nbsp;
Zhora makes a lot of money profiting from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:52.000
show. However, the more Sergei works, the more&nbsp;
he starts ignoring his wife and her needs. 
&nbsp;

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:56.960
For one of the episodes, Sergei brings his family&nbsp;
to a restaurant and asks them all to talk about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.960 --> 00:08:03.280
his pregnancy. Diana lashes out at the cameraman&nbsp;
and storms off, having had enough of the show.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:08.000
After the incident, all of his family members&nbsp;
leave, and Sergei is left alone for the first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:13.760
time. He realizes that he has let fame get to&nbsp;
his head but before he can fix his problems,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:19.200
a group of religious protesters protests against&nbsp;
him. When Sergei starts getting a lot of hate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:23.680
an opposing broadcasting company sues&nbsp;
his show for fraud. They claim that his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:29.360
pregnancy is just a publicity stunt organized&nbsp;
to make money. In the first hearing, Zhora can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:34.480
barely put his case forward while the prosecutor&nbsp;
impresses everyone with her thorough research.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:39.360
She shows the judge a file of Sergei's personal&nbsp;
bank account that has all the information about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:45.040
the profits he has made from his pregnancy. 
At home, Diana asks him to stop all the games&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:50.400
and live a normal life as they did before the&nbsp;
pregnancy but an agitated Sergei yells at her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:55.520
In the second hearing, Zhora brings Sergei in&nbsp;
front of the judge and shows his belly to everyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.520 --> 00:09:00.800
present there. He even presents the ultrasound&nbsp;
results as evidence. To prove him wrong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:06.160
the prosecutor brings Sergei’s gynecologist&nbsp;
to court. According to her, since Sergei is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:11.680
the doctor’s first patient, the doctor is not&nbsp;
experienced enough for such a complicated case.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:16.640
Instead, she shows the judge a research from&nbsp;
much more experienced doctors who claim that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:25.840
male pregnancy is impossible. By the end of the&nbsp;
hearing, Sergei seems to be losing the case.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:32.160
One day after an interview, Sergei returns&nbsp;
home to see that Diana has left him. He panics&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:36.640
and realizes how badly he had been treating&nbsp;
her recently. The only way for him to gain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:42.240
her trust back is by giving up the show.
Hence, in the next and the last hearing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:47.120
he doesn’t go to court. Zhora panics but&nbsp;
still gives a heartfelt speech about Sergei&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:52.320
being a great mother. Everyone in the court&nbsp;
claps for his excellent words but just then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:57.120
the judge receives a video sent by Sergei.&nbsp;
Zhora doesn’t think much of it and allows it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.120 --> 00:10:02.880
to play. To his utter surprise, in the video,&nbsp;
Sergei claims that he lied about the pregnancy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:08.800
and is sorry to everyone he hurt in the process.&nbsp;
He also asks for forgiveness from Diana who has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:14.560
always supported him. After hearing him confess,&nbsp;
the judge declares him guilty and charges him a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:21.040
fine of one million rubles. Everyone who believed&nbsp;
in him, including all his fans, is disappointed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:25.680
Sergei meets Diana at their favorite place&nbsp;
and apologizes for being a bad husband&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:31.280
and using his pregnancy as a tool. The two&nbsp;
kiss when suddenly, Sergei’s water breaks.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:36.240
He is rushed to the hospital where the doctors&nbsp;
successfully perform a c-section on him. 
&nbsp;

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:41.520
After the birth, Sergei tells his family that&nbsp;
he has chosen love over money. They are proud&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:46.240
of him for being brave. Diana brings their&nbsp;
baby and hands him to Sergei for the first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:52.560
time. Three years after the birth, Diana is in one&nbsp;
of her exhibitions that showcase the pictures she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:57.920
took of Sergei during his pregnancy. Their son&nbsp;
has grown taller and is playing with Zhora’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:04.560
daughters. A few months later, Diana prays to have&nbsp;
a set of twins. Her wish comes true, making her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:09.440
and Sergei pregnant at the same time. 
